From a273ee0187325399ed84061cabaf9b7026ac0c09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:36:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cl): translate, XY turn, A/B turn and vertical mirror
 for toolpaths

Add crates/cl/src/cl/transform.rs (re-exported as app::cl::transform):
translate, transform_xy, rotate_about_axis and mirror_plane. One
orthogonal map p -> M p + t carries moves, arc centres, cycles,
compensated spans and edge breaks. A reflection swaps G2/G3 and
G41/G42. PreserveClimb reverses each contour, profile or chamfer pass
between its entry and its retract. TransformError refuses thread
cycles, probe touches, C moves, tilted moves under a mirror, plasma
under a mirror or tilt, vertical arcs a map cannot keep, tilted canned
cycles, horizontal and tilted mirror planes, and passes that cannot
reverse safely.

Fixes #3011

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
